<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U sets Q3 dividend at $0.27/share.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U sets Q3 dividend at $0.27/share.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish-U.S. drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn, Inc said on Monday its board had set the company's dividend for the third quarter of 1996 at $0.27 per share.  </p>
<p>The record date of the dividend would be October 8, Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said in a statement, and the share would trade ex-dividend from October 4.</p>
<p>The last date for trade with dividend in both Stockholm and New York would be October 3, it said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
